## Summary
The application builds successfully, the configured development Supabase project is connected, and the core auth pages and route protections behave as expected. However, the registration flow currently fails in the observed user scenario and requires investigation before the remaining authentication flows can be validated with real test accounts.

The remaining authentication cases are blocked because approved development accounts and controlled email delivery are not yet available. These should be completed using trusted test identities before final sign-off.
